/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; href=&quot;https://tekion.com/legal/privacy/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

